    {"problem": "There's no natural gas on your street", "solution": "Rural homes, many lakeside and cottage-country properties and newer subdivisions built all-electric have no gas option. A forced-air electric furnace or an air handler heats the whole house through ducts with no tank, no delivery and no combustion."},
